    <entry>
        <title>Unyielding Will</title>
        <author>
            <name>Ting Lu</name>
        </author>
        <link href="https://tingyinglu.com/unyielding-will.html"/>
        <id>https://tingyinglu.com/unyielding-will.html</id>
        <media:content url="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/Daruma_05_feature_683x500_01.jpg" medium="image" />
            <category term="works"/>
            <category term="ceramics"/>

        <updated>2026-09-13T00:08:46+08:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/Daruma_05_feature_683x500_01.jpg" alt="" />
                    ｜Unyielding Will 頑強的意志力｜ This wheel-thrown Daruma holds a hidden bell that rings&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/Daruma_05_feature_683x500_01.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p>｜Unyielding Will 頑強的意志力｜</p>
<p class="p1">This wheel-thrown Daruma holds a hidden bell that rings in an instant—like a prayer calling forth inner strength. The body shifts from ivory to a gradient of deep indigo and slate blue, reflecting emotional transitions during adversity. Gold leaf highlights the focused gaze, while a hand-painted mountain on the back symbolizes faith and willpower. Smoke firing crackles mark life’s trials, urging us to rise again from every sudden fall.<span class="s1"><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span></span></p>
<p class="p1">這件手拉胚達摩，內藏鈴鐺，搖晃時在一瞬間響起的聲音，像喚神般喚醒內在的力量。作品由米白色起，逐漸轉為深藍至灰藍的青花漸層，象徵面對困境時心境的轉化與沉澱。達摩的雙眼周圍貼有金箔，散發堅定神采；背部手繪的青花山脈象徵堅持信念與不動如山的意志。煙燻燒結的細微裂紋，是生命歷練的痕跡，提醒我們：在任何一瞬的挫敗後，都要再站起來。</p>
<p>L25 x W25 x H30<br>Ceramic, <span class="s1">gold leaf. </span>Smoke firing. 陶瓷、<span class="s1">金箔</span>，煙燻燒成</p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/Daruma_04-Da.jpeg" alt="" width="702" height="936" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcset="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/responsive/Daruma_04-Da-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/responsive/Daruma_04-Da-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/responsive/Daruma_04-Da-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/13/responsive/Daruma_04-Da-lg.jpeg 1024w">
<figcaption>Unyielding Will 頑強的意志力｜2024</figcaption>
</figure>
            ]]>
        </content>
