                    Moose, please help! 駝鹿幫幫忙！｜2021 ｜Moose, please help! 駝鹿幫幫忙！｜ “Moose, please help!” is&hellip;
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_07_feature_683x500_01.jpg" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_06-Zhong.jpeg" alt="Moose, please help! 駝鹿幫幫忙！｜2021" width="702" height="702" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcset="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_06-Zhong-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_06-Zhong-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_06-Zhong-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_06-Zhong-lg.jpeg 1024w">
<figcaption>Moose, please help! 駝鹿幫幫忙！｜2021</figcaption>
</figure>
<p>｜Moose, please help! 駝鹿幫幫忙！｜</p>
<p class="p1">“Moose, please help!” is a ceramic sculpture born from personal limitation and symbolic longing. During a period of physical illness that kept me from walking, I yearned for the mountains—spaces of freedom and memory. I created this moose to hike for me, to carry a backpack and gather the mushrooms I love. With its sturdy legs, it walks the trail I can’t, fulfilling a wish I could no longer act on. This piece is not only about climbing; it’s about resilience, surrogacy, and tenderness in the face of constraint. It’s a quiet defiance—one footstep at a time.</p>
<p class="p1">「駝鹿幫幫忙」是一件融合個人體驗與象徵意義的陶瓷雕塑。創作期間，我正被身體的慢性病困住，難以行走或登山。山林，是我記憶中最自由的場域，香菇，是我童年與味覺的連結。於是我打造這隻駝鹿，背著登山包，緩緩走進山林，用牠的四肢代替我的腳，替我完成無法親身實踐的願望。它不只是攀登，而是在幫我重拾一段通往自然與內在的路。這件作品，是一場無聲的接力，也是對身體限制的一種溫柔對抗。</p>
<p>W 29 x D 20 x H 44 cm<br>Ceramic 陶瓷</p>
<figure class="post__image"><img loading="lazy" src="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_02-Zhong.jpeg" alt="" width="702" height="702" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" srcset="https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_02-Zhong-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_02-Zhong-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_02-Zhong-md.jpeg 768w ,https://tingyinglu.com/media/posts/11/responsive/2021_Tuo-Lu-Bang-Bang-Mang_S_02-Zhong-lg.jpeg 1024w">
